<section class="bde-f-container-2197-290 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-wrap"><div class="bde-f-container-2197-236 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-hero"><p class="bde-f-text-2197-233 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-stamp">
Last updated 21 September 2026
</p><h1 class="bde-f-text-2197-234 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h1">
Privacy Policy
</h1><p class="bde-f-text-2197-235 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-lede">
NBA Salaries is an independent research site covering player salaries, contracts and team payrolls. This policy explains what personal data the site collects, why, and what you can do about it. It applies to visitors in the United Kingdom, the European Economic Area and the United States.
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2197-239 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2197-237 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
The Short Version
</h2><p class="bde-f-text-2197-238 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
There are no accounts, no newsletter and no paywall. We run no advertising and no analytics. Unless you write to us, the only record of your visit is a server log and a pair of page counters. Nothing on this site is behind a form.
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2197-242 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel-alt"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2197-240 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
Who Is Responsible for Your Data
</h2><p class="bde-f-text-2197-241 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
This site is operated by an independent publisher based in the United Kingdom, acting as the data controller under the UK GDPR and the Data Protection Act 2018. You can reach us through the <a class="nbasalarie-legal-link" href="/contact/">contact form</a> with any question about this policy or about data we hold.
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2197-251 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2197-243 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
What We Collect
</h2><h3 class="bde-f-text-2197-244 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h3">
When You Use the Contact Form
</h3><p class="bde-f-text-2197-245 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
The contact form asks for your name, your email address, the subject of your enquiry, an optional link to a relevant page, and your message. We collect these so we can read and reply to what you sent. Submissions are stored in the site database and are also sent to the site owner by email. Our lawful basis is legitimate interest: you contacted us and we need the information to respond.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2197-246 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
If your message concerns a correction to our data, we may keep it as part of our editorial record so we can show why a figure changed.
</p><h3 class="bde-f-text-2197-247 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h3">
When You Browse the Site
</h3><p class="bde-f-text-2197-248 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
Our hosting and our content delivery network record standard server log information, including your IP address, browser type, the pages you request and the time of the request. This keeps the site running, helps diagnose faults and defends against abuse and automated attacks. The lawful basis is our legitimate interest in the security and reliability of the service. These logs are not used to build a profile of you.
</p><h3 class="bde-f-text-2197-249 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h3">
What We Do Not Collect
</h3><p class="bde-f-text-2197-250 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
We run no advertising and no analytics product. We do not ask for or store payment details. We operate no user accounts and no newsletter. We do not ask for your date of birth, we build no profiles of individual readers, and we make no attempt to identify you by name from your browsing.
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2197-255 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel-alt"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2197-252 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
Cookies
</h2><p class="bde-f-text-2197-253 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
The site sets four cookies: one session cookie that is strictly necessary for the site to work, and three belonging to the page builder, two of which simply count visits and page views. There are no advertising cookies and no analytics cookies. Names, purposes and lifetimes are all listed on our <a class="nbasalarie-legal-link" href="/cookie-notice/">Cookie Notice</a>.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2197-254 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
We run no behavioural tracking, so a Do Not Track or Global Privacy Control signal has nothing here to switch off.
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2197-264 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2197-256 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
Who Receives Your Data
</h2><p class="bde-f-text-2197-257 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
A few third parties necessarily receive your IP address, because your browser requests a file from them in order to render the page.
</p><div class="bde-f-container-2197-262 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-list"><p class="bde-f-text-2197-258 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-item">
Cloudflare delivers and protects the site, processing requests on our behalf.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2197-259 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-item">
Google Fonts serves the typefaces used across the site.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2197-260 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-item">
unpkg serves an open source animation library used for page effects.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2197-261 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-item">
cdn.nba.com serves official team logos and player headshots.
</p></div><p class="bde-f-text-2197-263 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
These providers receive the technical information any web server receives when it serves a file. They are not given your contact form submission, and we pass them nothing about you beyond the request itself. We do not sell personal data and we do not share it for advertising.
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2197-269 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel-alt"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2197-265 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
How Long Things Are Kept
</h2><p class="bde-f-text-2197-266 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
Contact form submissions are kept for as long as they are useful to answer your enquiry and to maintain our correction record, and are reviewed periodically. Server and security logs are retained on a short rolling basis by our hosting provider and our content delivery network. Cookies expire as set out in the Cookie Notice.
</p><h3 class="bde-f-text-2197-267 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h3">
Where Your Data Is Held
</h3><p class="bde-f-text-2197-268 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
The site is hosted in the United Kingdom or the European Economic Area. Some of the providers listed above operate globally and may process request data in the United States or elsewhere. Where personal data moves outside the UK or EEA, that transfer relies on the safeguards those providers have in place, including standard contractual clauses and, where applicable, certification under the EU-US and UK-US Data Privacy Framework.
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2197-274 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2197-270 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
Your Rights in the UK and the EEA
</h2><p class="bde-f-text-2197-271 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
You have the right to ask for a copy of the personal data we hold about you, to have it corrected, to have it deleted, to restrict or object to how we use it, and to receive it in a portable format. Where we rely on legitimate interest you may object, and we will stop unless we have compelling grounds not to. Exercising any of these is free and we will respond within one month.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2197-272 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
Use the <a class="nbasalarie-legal-link" href="/contact/">contact form</a> to make a request. In practice the only personal data we are likely to hold about you is a message you sent us, since we do not track readers.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2197-273 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
If you are unhappy with how we handle a request you can complain to the UK Information Commissioner's Office at ico.org.uk, or to your local supervisory authority in the EEA.
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2197-279 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel-alt"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2197-275 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
Your Rights in the United States
</h2><p class="bde-f-text-2197-276 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
If you are in California, you have the right to know what personal information is collected and for what purpose, to request its deletion, to correct it, and not to be treated differently for exercising those rights. Residents of other states with comparable privacy laws have similar rights.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2197-277 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
We do not sell personal information, and we do not share it for cross-context behavioural advertising as that term is defined under California law. To make a request, use the <a class="nbasalarie-legal-link" href="/contact/">contact form</a>.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2197-278 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
The categories we handle are limited: identifiers such as IP address; internet activity such as the pages you request; and, only if you write to us, the name, email address and message you chose to send.
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2197-282 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2197-280 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
Children
</h2><p class="bde-f-text-2197-281 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
This site publishes sports business research and is not directed at children. We do not knowingly collect personal data from anyone under 13. If you believe a child has sent us personal data through the contact form, tell us and we will delete it.
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2197-286 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel-alt"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2197-283 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
Our Data on Players and Teams
</h2><p class="bde-f-text-2197-284 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
The salary, contract and payroll figures published here concern the professional and contractual arrangements of public figures, compiled from published sources such as official league announcements and established salary databases. Our <a class="nbasalarie-legal-link" href="/methodology/">methodology page</a> explains how we source and check them.
</p><p class="bde-f-text-2197-285 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
If you are a player, an agent or a club representative and believe a published figure about you is inaccurate, tell us through the <a class="nbasalarie-legal-link" href="/contact/">contact form</a> and we will review it promptly.
</p></div><div class="bde-f-container-2197-289 bde-f-container nbasalarie-legal-panel"><h2 class="bde-f-text-2197-287 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-h2">
Changes to This Policy
</h2><p class="bde-f-text-2197-288 bde-f-text nbasalarie-legal-p">
This page describes the site as it is today. We update it when what we do changes, and change the date at the top.
</p></div></section>
